# Pins for the optional [export] extra (Excel workbook export via
# ccs_platform/application/exports/workbook.py). Installed on top of
# requirements.txt by deploy/Dockerfile.api — kept out of requirements.txt so the
# Gmail relay image, which shares that lockfile, does not pull in pandas/numpy.
#
# Bounds mirror pyproject.toml [project.optional-dependencies].export, which
# remains the source of truth. Dockerfile.api passes both lockfiles to a single
# pip invocation, so pip resolves them together and any drift between the shared
# transitive pins (python-dateutil, six) fails the build instead of silently
# upgrading whichever file is installed second.
#
# Generate the pinned requirements-export.txt with:
#   pip-compile requirements-export.in --output-file requirements-export.txt
pandas>=2.2
